Our verdict is not guilty.

30
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:57,200
Thank you so much.

31
00:01:57,600 --> 00:01:58,180
You were great.

32
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:00,220
Thank you for all your hard work.

33
00:02:00,780 --> 00:02:01,840
You're welcome, Robert.

34
00:02:02,240 --> 00:02:04,400
I knew you were innocent, so my job was easy.

35
